I tool 'hi' for running headscale integration tests\nwith Docker automation. The tool replaces manual Docker command\ncomposition with an automated solution.\n\nFeatures:\n- Run integration tests in golang:1.24 containers\n- Docker context detection (supports colima and other contexts)\n- Test isolation with unique run IDs and isolated control_logs\n- Automatic Docker image pulling and container management\n- Comprehensive cleanup operations for containers, networks, images\n- Docker volume caching for Go modules\n- Verbose logging and detailed test artifact reporting\n- Support for PostgreSQL/SQLite selection and various test flags\n\nUsage: go run ./cmd/hi run TestPingAllByIP --verbose\n\nThe tool uses creachadair/command and flax for CLI parsing and\nprovides cleanup subcommands for Docker resource management.\n\nUpdates flake.nix vendorHash for new Go dependencies.","parents":[{"sha":"bad783321e8ea0c77bd00933bfd5d18ec8e05bca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/bad783321e8ea0c77bd00933bfd5d18ec8e05bca","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/bad783321e8ea0c77bd00933bfd5d18ec8e05bca"}],"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgmMAoz5Zf+w0nAxyA6/zsNd95cP\n98YbtHIIXyy9A1sssAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQEabDeeHTskDYfE4WbckY3stISgQk+tXMP1VvnKW1vWiMGqZjE9e6u60qKpLduW6GW\nkX1tcu0C5YJSeeZ3mG3wM=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","payload":"tree 41ce86c47b0884cf519cf6c1a0385ed2d4af78b3\nparent bad783321e8ea0c77bd00933bfd5d18ec8e05bca\nauthor Kristoffer Dalby <kristoffer@tailscale.com> 1750185114 +0200\ncommitter Kristoffer Dalby <kristoffer@tailscale.com> 1750232533 +0200\n\ncmd/hi: add integration test runner CLI tool\n\nAdd a new CLI tool 'hi' for running headscale integration tests\nwith Docker automation. The tool replaces manual Docker command\ncomposition with an automated solution.\n\nFeatures:\n- Run integration tests in golang:1.24 containers\n- Docker context detection (supports colima and other contexts)\n- Test isolation with unique run IDs and isolated control_logs\n- Automatic Docker image pulling and container management\n- Comprehensive cleanup operations for containers, networks, images\n- Docker volume caching for Go modules\n- Verbose logging and detailed test artifact reporting\n- Support for PostgreSQL/SQLite selection and various test flags\n\nUsage: go run ./cmd/hi run TestPingAllByIP --verbose\n\nThe tool uses creachadair/command and flax for CLI parsing and\nprovides cleanup subcommands for Docker resource management.\n\nUpdates flake.nix vendorHash for new Go dependencies.\n","verified_at":"2025-06-18T07:42:20Z"},"event":"committed"},{"sha":"5fc3db7aa3ec94ec670367c198cdc6de354b9e99","node_id":"C_kwDOEFLz89oAKDVmYzNkYjdhYTNlYzk0ZWM2NzAzNjdjMTk4Y2RjNmRlMzU0YjllOTk","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/5fc3db7aa3ec94ec670367c198cdc6de354b9e99","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/5fc3db7aa3ec94ec670367c198cdc6de354b9e99","author":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@tailscale.com","date":"2025-06-17T18:41:40Z"},"committer":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@tailscale.com","date":"2025-06-18T07:42:14Z"},"tree":{"sha":"192f4f7364064983a68acb5646499afa0d6ce310","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/trees/192f4f7364064983a68acb5646499afa0d6ce310"},"message":"ci: update integration tests to use hi CLI tool\n\nReplace manual Docker command composition in GitHub Actions\nworkflow with the new hi CLI tool for running integration tests.\n\nChanges:\n- Replace complex docker run command with simple 'go run ./cmd/hi run'\n- Remove manual environment variable setup (handled by hi tool)\n- Update artifact paths for new timestamped log directory structure\n- Simplify command from 15+ lines to 3 lines\n- Maintain all existing functionality (postgres/sqlite, timeout, test patterns)\n\nThe hi tool automatically handles Docker context detection, container\nmanagement, volume mounting, and environment variable setup that was\npreviously done manually in the workflow.","parents":[{"sha":"da58865514438baca93ad11b7d6bba2658dbad74","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/da58865514438baca93ad11b7d6bba2658dbad74","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/da58865514438baca93ad11b7d6bba2658dbad74"}],"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgmMAoz5Zf+w0nAxyA6/zsNd95cP\n98YbtHIIXyy9A1sssAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQOJCgxd/SDo9Gl0E7epXmvOgxCnRe2LVK5ruhZhjvGOMPrC5qwvNJBc/w1Bs0h607p\n3zBbl3BAHsxuWAEKVyXg0=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","payload":"tree 192f4f7364064983a68acb5646499afa0d6ce310\nparent da58865514438baca93ad11b7d6bba2658dbad74\nauthor Kristoffer Dalby <kristoffer@tailscale.com> 1750185700 +0200\ncommitter Kristoffer Dalby <kristoffer@tailscale.com> 1750232534 +0200\n\nci: update integration tests to use hi CLI tool\n\nReplace manual Docker command composition in GitHub Actions\nworkflow with the new hi CLI tool for running integration tests.\n\nChanges:\n- Replace complex docker run command with simple 'go run ./cmd/hi run'\n- Remove manual environment variable setup (handled by hi tool)\n- Update artifact paths for new timestamped log directory structure\n- Simplify command from 15+ lines to 3 lines\n- Maintain all existing functionality (postgres/sqlite, timeout, test patterns)\n\nThe hi tool automatically handles Docker context detection, container\nmanagement, volume mounting, and environment variable setup that was\npreviously done manually in the workflow.\n","verified_at":"2025-06-18T07:42:20Z"},"event":"committed"},{"sha":"3e00850c8d9fdb76a99f901b357e48014ac62527","node_id":"C_kwDOEFLz89oAKDNlMDA4NTBjOGQ5ZmRiNzZhOTlmOTAxYjM1N2U0ODAxNGFjNjI1Mjc","url":"https: